{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Arcade Boss Simulator is an arcade store simulation where you profit from arcade machines and collect those coins to expand.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Boss Around:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Organize your store the way you want , provide your customers with a wide selection to increase profits.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3725770/extras/MachineMovement.gif?t=1746768661\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Boss Prizes:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Buy prizes to meet your customers requirements. Unlock new prize collections to display in your store or reward your customers with.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3725770/extras/PrizePurchase.gif?t=1746768661\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Boss Decor:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Add in fun decor to your store from a selection of neon signs and lights.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3725770/extras/DecorPlacement.gif?t=1746768661\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Boss Expansion:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Keep expanding to add more machines to your store and keep up with the increasing customer demands.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3725770/extras/Expansion.gif?t=1746768661\" /></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3725770?t=1746768661","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3725770?t=1746768661","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3725770/5426